:40.834Z\",\"dataSensitivity\":\"non_sensitive\",\"description\":\"This is the exchange rate used to convert the deal amount into your company currency.\",\"displayOrder\":-1,\"externalOptions\":false,\"fieldType\":\"number\",\"formField\":false,\"groupName\":\"deal_revenue\",\"hasUniqueValue\":false,\"hidden\":false,\"hubspotDefined\":true,\"label\":\"Exchange rate\",\"modificationMetadata\":{\"archivable\":true,\"readOnlyDefinition\":true,\"readOnlyValue\":false},\"name\":\"hs_exchange_rate\",\"numberDisplayHint\":\"unformatted\",\"options\":[],\"type\":\"number\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-01-19T19:17:39.963Z\"},{\"calculated\":true,\"calculationFormula\":\"if is_present(hs_forecast_probability) then (hs_forecast_probability * amount_in_home_currency) else amount_in_home_currency\",\"createdAt\":\"2020-10-29T20:22:45.530Z\",\"dataSensitivity\":\"non_sensitive\",\"description\":\"The custom forecasted deal value calculated by multiplying the forecast probability and deal amount in your company’s currency.\",\"displayOrder\":-1,\"externalOptions\":false,\"fieldType\":\"number\",\"formField\":false,\"groupName\":\"dealinformation\",\"hasUniqueValue\":false,\"hidden\":false,\"hubspotDefined\":true,\"label\":\"Forecast amount\",\"modificationMetadata\":{\"archivable\":true,\"readOnlyDefinition\":true,\"readOnlyValue\":true},\"name\":\"hs_forecast_amount\",\"numberDisplayHint\":\"currency\",\"options\":[],\"showCurrencySymbol\":true,\"type\":\"number\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-03-27T20:26:15.448Z\"},{\"calculated\":false,\"createdAt\":\"2020-10-29T20:17:48.778Z\",\"dataSensitivity\":\"non_sensitive\",\"description\":\"The custom percent probability a deal will close.\",\"displayOrder\":-1,\"externalOptions\":false,\"fieldType\":\"number\",\"formField\":false,\"groupName\":\"dealinformation\",\"hasUniqueValue\":false,\"hidden\":false,\"hubspotDefined\":true,\"label\":\"Forecast probability\",\"modificationMetadata\":{\"archivable\":true,\"readOnlyDefinition\":true,\"readOnlyValue\":false},\"name\":\"hs_forecast_probability\",\"numberDisplayHint\":\"percentage\",\"options\":[],\"type\":\"number\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-03-27T20:26:15.448Z\"},{\"calculated\":false,\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-10T08:36:06.152Z\",\"dataSensitivity\":\"non_sensitive\",\"description\":\"ID of the form that created the Deal object\",\"displayOrder\":-1,\"externalOptions\":false,\"fieldType\":\"calculation_rollup\",\"formField\":false,\"groupName\":\"dealinformation\",\"hasUniqueValue\":false,\"hidden\":false,\"hubspotDefined\":true,\"label\":\"Form ID\",\"modificationMetadata\":{\"archivable\":true,\"readOnlyDefinition\":true,\"readOnlyValue\":true},\"name\":\"hs_form_id\",\"options\":[],\"type\":\"string\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-10T08:36:06.152Z\"},{\"calculated\":false,\"createdAt\":\"2024-05-16T14:05:17.485Z\",\"dataSensitivity\":\"non_sensitive\",\"description\":\"True if the deal is missing conditional stage property values required to progress to the next deal stage.  This is set automatically by HubSpot based on user actions in the deal record.\",\"displayOrder\":-1,\"externalOptions\":false,\"fieldType\":\"booleancheckbox\",\"formField\":false,\"groupName\":\"dealinformation\",\"hasUniqueValue\":false,\"hidden\":true,\"hubspotDefined\":true,\"label\":\"Has Empty Conditional Stage Properties\",\"modificationMetadata\":{\"archivable\":true,\"readOnlyDefinition\":true,\"readOnlyValue\":true},\"name\":\"hs_has_empty_conditional_stage_properties\",\"options\":[{\"displayOrder\":0,\"hidden\":false,\"label\":\"Yes\",\"value\":\"true\"},{\"displayOrder\":1,\"hidden\":false,\"label\":\"No\",\"value\":\"false\"}],\"type\":\"bool\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-10-02T16:55:54.640Z\"},{\"calculated\":true,\"calculationFormula\":\"is_present(string(hs_last_conversation_with_followups_object_coordinates))\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-03-03T22:24:30.740Z\",\"dataSensitivity\":\"non_sensitive\",\"description\":\"Indicates if the most recent conversation has follow ups. True if hs_last_conversation_with_followups_object_coordinates has a value, false otherwise.\",\"displayOrder\":-1,\"externalOptions\":false,\"fieldType\":\"calculation_equation\",\"formField\":false,\"groupName\":\"deal_activity\",\"hasUniqueValue\":false,\"hidden\":false,\"hubspotDefined\":true,\"label\":\"Has Last Conversation Follow Ups\",\"modificationMetadata\":{\"archivable\":true,\"readOnlyDefinition\":true,\"readOnlyValue\":true},\"name\":\"hs_has_last_conversation_follow_ups\",\"options\":[{\"displayOrder\":0,\"hidden\":false,\"label\":\"Yes\",\"value\":\"true\"},{\"displayOrder\":1,\"hidden\":false,\"label\":\"No\",\"value\":\"false\"}],\"type\":\"bool\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-03-03T22:24:30.740Z\"},{\"calculated\":true,\"calculationFormula\":\"is_present(hs_last_meeting_id_with_followups)\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-12-04T19:49:21.447Z\",\"dataSensitivity\":\"non_sensitive\",\"description\":\"Indicates if the most recent meeting has follow ups. True if hs_last_meeting_id_with_followups has a value, false otherwise.\",\"displayOrder\":-1,\"externalOptions\":false,\"fieldType\":\"calculation_equation\",\"formField\":false,\"groupName\":\"deal_activity\",\"hasUniqueValue\":false,\"hidden\":false,\"hubspotDefined\":true,\"label\":\"Has Last Meeting Follow Ups\",\"modificationMetadata\":{\"archivable\":true,\"readOnlyDefinition\":true,\"readOnlyValue\":true},\"name\":\"hs_has_last_meeting_followups\",\"options\":[{\"displayOrder\":0,\"hidden\":false,\"label\":\"True\",\"value\":\"true\"},{\"displayOrder\":1,\"hidden\":false,\"label\":\"False\",\"value\":\"false\"}],\"type\":\"bool\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-01-12T19:13:43.020Z\"},{\"calculated\":false,\"createdAt\":\"2024-01-10T18:05:14.186Z\",\"dataSensitivity\":\"non_sensitive\",\"description\":\"Indicates if the current deal is an active shared deal. It is set automatically based on the value of hs_num_associated_active_deal_registrations.\",\"displayOrder\":-1,\"externalOptions\":false,\"fieldType\":\"booleancheckbox\",\"formField\":false